OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after police
OL,4,Afirearms incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in hospital after being
OL,7,Finjured in a shooting involving armed
OL,8,Fpolice.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police responded to
OL,11,Freports of a suspected firearm at an
OL,12,Faddress on Fishponds Road, Bristol,
OL,13,Fafter receiving a call from the public
OL,14,Fat 17:30 BST on Thursday.
OL,16,F"Negotiators had not yet arrived when
OL,17,Fpolice firearms were discharged," a
OL,18,Fforce statement said.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
