OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after police
OL,4,Afirearms incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force has referred itself to the
OL,7,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,8,F(IOPC) over the incident. The man was
OL,9,Fsaid to be conscious and breathing when
OL,10,Fhe arrived at hospital and is receiving
OL,11,Ftreatment for injuries not believed to
OL,12,Fbe life-threatening.
